msgctxt "2026960B-6A231EAA-00162F00"
msgid "JENXPARIS Pont Neuf. The Pont Neuf is, despite its name, the oldest[3] standing bridge across the river Seine in Paris, France. Its name, which was given to distinguish it from older bridges that were lined on both sides with houses, has remained."
msgstr "JENXPARIS 新桥。新桥尽管名为“新桥”，却是法国巴黎塞纳河上现存最古老的桥梁[3]。其名称是为了将其与两侧曾建有房屋的更古老桥梁区分开来，并沿用至今。"

msgctxt "2026960B-6A231EAA-00172F00"
msgid "JENXPARIS Pont Royal. The Pont Royal is a bridge crossing the river Seine in Paris. It is the third oldest bridge in Paris, after the Pont Neuf and the Pont Marie."
msgstr "JENXPARIS 皇家桥。皇家桥是横跨巴黎塞纳河的一座桥，是巴黎第三古老的桥梁，仅次于新桥和玛丽桥。"

msgctxt "2026960B-6A231EAA-00182F00"
msgid "JENXPARIS Pont Saint Michel. Pont Saint-Michel is a bridge linking the Place Saint-Michel on the left bank of the river Seine to the Île de la Cité. It was named after the nearby chapel of Saint-Michel. It is near Sainte Chapelle and the Palais de Justice. The present 62-metre-long bridge dates to 1857."
msgstr "JENXPARIS 圣米歇尔桥。圣米歇尔桥连接塞纳河左岸的圣米歇尔广场与西岱岛，因附近的圣米歇尔小教堂而得名。它靠近圣礼拜堂和司法宫。现桥长62米，建于1857年。"

msgctxt "2026960B-6A231EAA-00192F00"
msgid "JENXOLD Tower Bridge. Tower Bridge is a combined bascule and suspension bridge in London, England, over the River Thames. It is close to the Tower of London, which gives it its name."
msgstr "JENXOLD 塔桥。塔桥是英国伦敦泰晤士河上的一座开启桥与悬索桥结合体，靠近伦敦塔，因此得名。"

